# Invoice reading component (class/convomaileinvoice, convomailpdfembedded, convomailinvoiceai, convomailinvoicereader)
# Problems found while reading an invoice. Arguments are field names, line numbers or an AI service's error message, never text from the document.
InvoiceReaderAiError = The AI service returned an error.
InvoiceReaderAiOff = The AI module is not enabled.
InvoiceReaderAiErrorDetail = The AI service returned an error: %s
InvoiceReaderAiTooLong = The AI answer is too long.
InvoiceReaderAiNotJson = The AI answer could not be read.
InvoiceReaderFieldIgnored = An unexpected field (%s) was ignored.
InvoiceReaderUnnamedFieldIgnored = An unexpected field was ignored.
InvoiceReaderFieldRejected = The value read for %s was not used: it is not valid.
InvoiceReaderFieldPlaceholder = The value read for %s was not used: it is a privacy placeholder.
InvoiceReaderDateOutOfRange = The date read for %s was not used: it is more than 2 years away.
InvoiceReaderDueBeforeDate = The due date is before the invoice date.
InvoiceReaderTooManyLines = Only the first %s VAT lines were kept.
InvoiceReaderLineRejected = VAT line %s was not used: it is not valid.
InvoiceReaderLinePlaceholder = VAT line %s was not used: it holds a privacy placeholder.
InvoiceReaderLineFieldsIgnored = VAT line %s had unexpected fields, ignored.
InvoiceReaderLineVatMismatch = VAT line %s: the VAT amount does not match the amount times the rate.
InvoiceReaderLinesNetMismatch = The VAT lines do not add up to the total without VAT.
InvoiceReaderLinesVatMismatch = The VAT lines do not add up to the total VAT.
InvoiceReaderTotalMismatch = The total without VAT plus the VAT does not equal the total.
InvoiceReaderLinesTotalMismatch = The VAT lines do not add up to the total.
InvoiceReaderNoRates = No VAT rates are known for your company's country: the rates were not checked.
InvoiceReaderRateUnknown = VAT line %s: the rate is not one of your country's VAT rates.
InvoiceReaderEncryptedPdf = A PDF is password-protected and could not be read.
InvoiceReaderCurrencyUnknown = The invoice's currency is not in the currency dictionary.
